{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "同船的公子？周德茂，做布匹。今夜赶武昌，明早要看一批货。",
      "emotion": "serious",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "周老板做什么生意？",
          "goto": "ask_background",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "为什么赶夜船？",
          "goto": "ask_night_ferry",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "那箱货是什么？",
          "goto": "press_cargo_marks",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_background": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "周老板是做什么生意的？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "布匹。荆江来的细布，转到武昌早市，一口价。辰时开市午时裁完，去晚了连布头都轮不上。阿贵！箱子靠墙！磕掉漆了你赔？",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "business"
        },
        {
          "text": "就专跑荆江这一路？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "粗的细的都做。可这一趟不一样……南京来了信，说武昌有人点名要这批货，晚了就换别家。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "business"
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵跟你挺久了？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年。搬货看箱还行，账册货银……他碰不得。十二年了我心里有数。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "brusque"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_night_ferry": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked",
        "cabin_friend_pressed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "这么晚还赶路，武昌有急事？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "武昌早市辰时开，午前好布就被挑完。误了这趟，银子就落到别人袋里了。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "impatient"
        },
        {
          "text": "白天出发赶不上？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "不行。南京递话的人说了……这批货等不得。还说石矶渡老范的船今夜正好走武昌。我就来了。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "serious"
        },
        {
          "text": "递话的……什么人？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "做药材的。她说老范跑了二十年水路，夜里也稳。我信她，也信这趟买卖。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "brusque"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_cargo_marks": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_observed"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "（这箱子……从上船起他就没松过手。指节都发白了。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "从上船就没离过手……要紧东西？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "红的装布样和货契，铜锁的……账册。做生意的人，这些东西比衣裳要紧。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "business"
        },
        {
          "text": "货银也在里头？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "五十两……在我贴身小箱里，不在这口。到了武昌要马上兑货，少一两都谈不成。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "business"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以阿贵守外箱。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "他只守外箱。真要紧的我自己盯。他手脚快，脑子……不该伸到生意里。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "brusque"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_business": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_zhou_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "这趟挺急的。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "急得很。买家只等一上午……辰时看货，午前定价，过时就去别家了。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "business"
        },
        {
          "text": "所以冒雨赶夜船。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "五十两压在身上，晚半日就可能白跑一趟。做生意不是读书……错过时辰没人等你。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "brusque"
        },
        {
          "text": "行了书生，你读你的圣贤书。到了武昌各走各的。阿贵！去看看老范舵稳不稳……这浪颠得我胃里又翻。",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_de_gui_cabin",
          "emotion": "dismissive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
